# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/lee2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: SevenNet-architecture models trained on MatPES-PBE-2025.1
# (baseline), retrained from scratch with sodium-oxide augmentation
# sets chosen by Random, DIRECT or LCMD sampling under a fixed DFT
# budget, or fine-tuned from the baseline with replay and EWC; force MAEs
# on the AIMD validation set (Sec. Results). Distance-binned RMSEs,
# force-softening scales and MD properties are not encoded as results.

